=2 Walkthrough
* The goal of the assault is to collect more supplies than the immortals.
** Supplies are temporary items dropped from Imps.
* Imps will not appear anywhere on the map until one player talks to the NPC **Kuihlud** at the start.

* An Immortal can stop you from getting supplies if they perform an action against an imp.
* The Immortal can get the supplies even if your party kills the Imp.
** Not all Imps drop supplies.

When you obtain supplies it is displayed in the chat log as a temporary item.
* The chat log will regularly display how many supplies have been collected by the Immortals.
* The mission ends when all Imps on the map have been defeated.
* The mission is complete if you obtain 6 temporary items before the immortals, even if there's still imps on the map.

* If you have more supplies than the Immortals, you win.
* If you have less than or an equal number of supplies as the Immortals, you lose.

* The Rune of Release will appear next to **Kuihlud** back at the start point.

